==== hyperbricks yaml {!{page}} ====
page:
  - type: hypermedia
  - route: head-generated-items
  - head:
      - type: head
      - title: Generated title should not render
      - payload:
          - type: html
          - value: <title>Manual payload</title>
      - custom_head:
          - type: html
          - value: <meta name="custom" content="yes">
      - generator:
          - type: html
          - value: <meta name="generator" content="manual">
==== explainer ====
HEAD generated items are normal ordered Items. The named generator and payload items can be overridden from YAML.
==== expected materialized json ====
{
  "@order": [
    "head"
  ],
  "@type": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "head": {
    "@order": [
      "payload",
      "custom_head",
      "generator"
    ],
    "@type": "<HEAD>",
    "custom_head": {
      "@type": "<HTML>",
      "value": "<meta name=\"custom\" content=\"yes\">"
    },
    "generator": {
      "@type": "<HTML>",
      "value": "<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"manual\">"
    },
    "payload": {
      "@type": "<HTML>",
      "value": "<title>Manual payload</title>"
    },
    "title": "Generated title should not render"
  },
  "route": "head-generated-items"
}
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>Manual payload</title><meta name="custom" content="yes"><meta name="generator" content="manual"></head><body></body></html>
